    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1474850/extras/2c245d791114e8c40dd1699b0ee7c1e2.avif?t=1715043166\" /></div><br>Black ido is a super suit that can change gravity and protect the main character named TSK from falling from a great height.  <br><br>Feature of game:  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Adventure with the change of gravity  <br></li><li>Collecting coins <br></li><li>Convenient control <br></li><li>Challenging levels <br></li><li>Physics, doors, keys and traps. </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1474850/extras/86352909f9e5cfb9e68d53836701d560.poster.avif?t=1715043166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1474850/extras/86352909f9e5cfb9e68d53836701d560.webm?t=1715043166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1474850/extras/86352909f9e5cfb9e68d53836701d560.mp4?t=1715043166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br>In the game you have to change the gravity and use the geometry of the level to solve puzzles.",
